Generated scene/recall/names/address modules use checked import/field-limit patches; originals are never edited.
Tests under tests/upstream/ preserve the upstream core tests (import paths adjusted); test-compact-date.cjs omits
Marinara tracker assertions and test-speakers.cjs omits its server-patch assertion. The pure emotional-continuity tests
are retained; its staged-rebuild case is adapted in tests/memory-sync.test.js.
tests/upstream-*.test.js adapt the language, translation fit/recovery/split, edit-during-read and library retry UI tests
to the Lumiverse service, storage, host adapter and patched UI. tests/upstream-harness.js bridges the upstream fixtures
to the fake Spindle host. CHANGELOG.md and REPORT-1.2.0.md list excluded Marinara-only and deferred feature tests.
New 0.12.6 suites include pure attribution/alias/bilingual/knowledge/world cores and adapter-based name/alias
editing, attribution modes/concurrent edits and knowledge routes. UI cases exercise the patched Lumiverse screen.
The optional state/place/keepsake core tests do not imply those UI features are enabled.
tests/memory-branch.test.js ports the original's test-branches.cjs. tests/fake-model.js adapts the answer scripts (ledgerReply,
sceneReply and the prompt recognition) of the original's tests/fake-llm.mjs.
memory-module/lib/service.cjs (Marinara engine glue) is NOT copied: src/memory/service.js is a rewrite for Lumiverse
that keeps its logic (batching, retries, scene/chapter/arc order, recall) and replaces the engine, file and server parts.

